==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|is|jeg||before ''je'' → ''é'' reform}}
* {{alt|is|eg||archaic, poetic}}
* {{alt|is|ek||very archaic}}

===Etymology===
The Icelandic pronoun continues {{der|is|non|ek}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*ek}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*éǵh₂}}. The pronoun is attested, in {{der|is|gmq-pro|-}} inscriptions, since at least the 3rd century.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/jɛɣ/|[jɛːɣ̊]}}
* {{audio|is|Is-ég.oga|Audio}}
* {{rhymes|is|ɛːɣ|s=1}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|is|pronoun|cat2=personal pronouns}}

